    <description>A massive crystal chamber made out of precious chronite. This structure allows a tribe to shape and evolve larger lithic items and weapons.
The chronite of this forge has immense charge potential, giving it a large discount on shocksap usage. However, the forge cannot make smaller items, and and isn't as time-efficient.
Having a terrathyst crucible is still highly recommended due to it's ability to make smaller items, and because of it's time effeciency.</description>
